        "description": "Course includes fundamental theories and algorithms of digital image acquisition, color representation, sampling and quantization, frequency transform via DFT, enhancement, filtering, restoration, analysis, feature extraction, segmentation, morphological transform, and compression. Practical applications such as JPEG compression will be covered.",
