        },
        {
            "label": "CO3",
            "raw_text": "Students are be able to apply image processing techniques in spatial and Fourier domain."
        },
        {
            "label": "CO4",
            "raw_text": "Students are be able to analyze spatial and frequency domain properties for compression"
        },
        {
            "label": "CO5",
